<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica mohair prices mixed at last winter sale.</title>
<headline>SAfrica mohair prices mixed at last winter sale.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African mohair prices for the last mohair sale were mixed, the Mohair Board said.</p>
<p>Of the 1,952 bales offered 34 percent was sold.</p>
<p>Approximate prices in South African cents a kg:</p>
<p>Adults	  long	 2350-3000	(2350-3400)</p>
<p>		  medium     2200-2200	(2252-2252)</p>
<p>		  short	2000-2050	(2050-2190)</p>
<p>Young Goats   long	 2400-3992	(2350-3402)</p>
<p>		  medium     2200-2300	(2200-2300)</p>
<p>		  short	2050-2050	(2080-2372)</p>
<p>Fine Kids     long	 2800-8000	(2750-7000)</p>
<p>		  medium     2700-3300	(2700-3300)</p>
<p>		  short	2800-3202	(2100-3302)</p>
<p>The first sumer sale of the season is scheduled for February 25, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27-11 482 1003</p>
</text>
